# Dev server port

This project runs on **port 3001** only (`http://localhost:3001`).

- Do not use ports 3000 or 3002 — those belong to other projects on this machine.
- Prefer `npm run dev` (already pinned to 3001 in `package.json`).
- If starting Next manually, always pass `--port 3001`.
